---
/**
 * DoneExamples — one definition of done, in its two real forms.
 *
 * Principle 1 says humans define done before the loop starts, but "definition
 * of done" is abstract until you see one. This figure shows a single small
 * task (orders CSV export) defined twice: on the left the spec as written in
 * human words, on the right the same done as an apo test the environment can
 * run. Same task, same destination — one form talks to people, the other
 * talks to the loop.
 *
 * Static, no interaction. Same idiom as Formula: self-themed dark panel,
 * not-prose, pairs with the post's other widgets.
 */
---

<figure class="dod not-prose" data-done-examples>
	<figcaption class="dod__sr-only">
		One definition of done in two forms. Left, a spec written in human
		words: the orders table gets an Export CSV button, clicking downloads
		the currently visible rows with filters applied, columns match the
		table, dates are ISO 8601, amounts are plain numbers, and exporting
		10,000 rows must not freeze the page; everything else is left to the
		agent. Right, the same done as an apo test with four named checks:
		the button exists, the file name matches the expected shape, the rows
		respect the filters, and a judge verifies the contents.
	</figcaption>

	<div class="dod__grid">
		<div class="dod__card dod__card--spec">
			<div class="dod__tab">
				<span class="dod__file">export-orders.spec.md</span>
				<span class="dod__tag dod__tag--human">spec</span>
			</div>
			<div class="dod__body dod__body--spec">
				<p class="dod__h">done when</p>
				<ul class="dod__list">
					<li>the orders table gets an <em>Export CSV</em> button, top right</li>
					<li>clicking it downloads <code>orders-&lt;date&gt;.csv</code> — the rows currently visible, filters applied</li>
					<li>columns and their order match the table</li>
					<li>dates ISO 8601, amounts plain numbers, no thousand separators</li>
					<li>exporting 10k rows doesn't freeze the page</li>
				</ul>
				<p class="dod__h dod__h--out">left to the agent</p>
				<p class="dod__note">everything above that — implementation, library, code structure</p>
			</div>
		</div>

		<span class="dod__arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</span>

		<div class="dod__card dod__card--eval">
			<div class="dod__tab">
				<span class="dod__file">export-orders.eval.ts</span>
				<span class="dod__tag dod__tag--run">apo test</span>
			</div>
			<div class="dod__body dod__body--eval">
				<div class="dod__t">
					<span class="dod__l"><span class="c-k">test</span>(<span class="c-s">"export-button-visible"</span>, (t) <span class="c-k">=&gt;</span> <span class="c-b">&#123;</span></span>
					<span class="dod__l dod__l--in">t.<span class="c-f">selectorExists</span>(<span class="c-s">"button"</span>, <span class="c-b">&#123;</span> text: <span class="c-s">"Export CSV"</span> <span class="c-b">&#125;</span>);</span>
					<span class="dod__l"><span class="c-b">&#125;);</span></span>
				</div>
				<div class="dod__t">
					<span class="dod__l"><span class="c-k">test</span>(<span class="c-s">"file-shape"</span>, (t, <span class="c-b">&#123;</span> deliverables <span class="c-b">&#125;</span>) <span class="c-k">=&gt;</span> <span class="c-b">&#123;</span></span>
					<span class="dod__l dod__l--in">t.<span class="c-f">check</span>(deliverables.file, <span class="c-f">matches</span>(<span class="c-s">/orders-\d&#123;4&#125;-\d&#123;2&#125;-\d&#123;2&#125;\.csv/</span>));</span>
					<span class="dod__l"><span class="c-b">&#125;);</span></span>
				</div>
				<div class="dod__t">
					<span class="dod__l"><span class="c-k">test</span>(<span class="c-s">"rows-respect-filters"</span>, (t, <span class="c-b">&#123;</span> deliverables <span class="c-b">&#125;</span>) <span class="c-k">=&gt;</span> <span class="c-b">&#123;</span></span>
					<span class="dod__l dod__l--in">t.<span class="c-f">check</span>(deliverables.rows, <span class="c-f">equalsVisibleRows</span>());</span>
					<span class="dod__l"><span class="c-b">&#125;);</span></span>
				</div>
				<div class="dod__t">
					<span class="dod__l"><span class="c-k">test</span>(<span class="c-s">"contents-honest"</span>, <span class="c-k">async</span> (t, <span class="c-b">&#123;</span> deliverables <span class="c-b">&#125;</span>) <span class="c-k">=&gt;</span> <span class="c-b">&#123;</span></span>
					<span class="dod__l dod__l--in"><span class="c-k">await</span> t.<span class="c-f">judge</span>(deliverables.contents, <span class="c-s">"PASS when columns match the table, dates ISO 8601, amounts unformatted."</span>);</span>
					<span class="dod__l"><span class="c-b">&#125;);</span></span>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
	</div>
</figure>

<style>
	.dod {
		margin: 2rem auto;
		max-width: 46rem;
		padding: 1rem;
		border: 1px solid #404040;
		border-radius: 0.5rem;
		background: #0d0d0d;
		color: #f4f4f5;
		font-family: ui-monospace, "SF Mono", "Cascadia Code", "Roboto Mono", monospace;
	}

	.dod__sr-only {
		position: absolute;
		width: 1px;
		height: 1px;
		padding: 0;
		margin: -1px;
		overflow: hidden;
		clip: rect(0, 0, 0, 0);
		white-space: nowrap;
		border: 0;
	}

	.dod__grid {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: 1fr 1.5rem 1fr;
		align-items: stretch;
		gap: 0.25rem;
	}

	.dod__arrow {
		display: flex;
		align-items: center;
		justify-content: center;
		color: #767f96;
		font-size: 0.9rem;
	}

	.dod__card {
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		min-width: 0;
		border: 1px solid #404040;
		border-radius: 0.4rem;
		background: #111111;
		overflow: hidden;
	}

	/* Tab bar: filename + form tag. Amber = human words, green = runnable. */
	.dod__tab {
		display: flex;
		align-items: center;
		justify-content: space-between;
		gap: 0.5rem;
		padding: 0.45rem 0.6rem;
		border-bottom: 1px solid #262626;
		background: #171717;
	}

	.dod__file {
		overflow: hidden;
		color: #d4d4d4;
		font-size: 0.66rem;
		text-overflow: ellipsis;
		white-space: nowrap;
	}

	.dod__tag {
		flex-shrink: 0;
		padding: 0.1rem 0.4rem;
		border-radius: 0.25rem;
		font-size: 0.55rem;
		font-weight: 600;
		letter-spacing: 0.07em;
		text-transform: uppercase;
	}

	.dod__tag--human {
		border: 1px solid #b98c45;
		color: #d9b06a;
	}

	.dod__tag--run {
		border: 1px solid #2a4a38;
		color: #4ade80;
	}

	/* ── spec side: prose ────────────────────────────────────────────── */

	.dod__body--spec {
		flex: 1;
		padding: 0.7rem 0.75rem 0.8rem;
		font-family: var(--aw-font-sans, ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif);
	}

	.dod__h {
		margin: 0 0 0.35rem;
		color: #a3a3a3;
		font-size: 0.6rem;
		font-weight: 600;
		letter-spacing: 0.09em;
		text-transform: uppercase;
	}

	.dod__h--out {
		margin-top: 0.75rem;
		color: #737373;
	}

	.dod__list {
		margin: 0;
		padding: 0;
		list-style: none;
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		gap: 0.3rem;
	}

	.dod__list li {
		position: relative;
		padding-left: 0.85rem;
		color: #f4f4f5;
		font-size: 0.78rem;
		line-height: 1.45;
	}

	.dod__list li::before {
		content: "–";
		position: absolute;
		left: 0;
		color: #737373;
	}

	.dod__list em {
		color: #fafafa;
		font-style: normal;
		font-weight: 600;
	}

	.dod__list code {
		color: #4ade80;
		font-family: ui-monospace, "SF Mono", "Cascadia Code", "Roboto Mono", monospace;
		font-size: 0.72rem;
	}

	.dod__note {
		margin: 0;
		color: #a3a3a3;
		font-size: 0.72rem;
		line-height: 1.45;
	}

	/* ── eval side: code ─────────────────────────────────────────────── */

	.dod__body--eval {
		flex: 1;
		padding: 0.7rem 0.75rem 0.8rem;
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		gap: 0.6rem;
	}

	/* One test block per row; each line is a block span so spacing comes
	   from CSS, never from source whitespace. */
	.dod__t {
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		gap: 0.1rem;
	}

	.dod__l {
		display: block;
		color: #d4d4d4;
		font-size: 0.68rem;
		line-height: 1.5;
		white-space: pre-wrap;
		word-break: break-word;
		/* Continuation of a wrapped line aligns under the first character. */
		padding-left: 1.1em;
		text-indent: -1.1em;
	}

	.dod__l--in {
		padding-left: 1.6em;
	}

	.dod__l--in.dod__l {
		text-indent: 0;
	}

	/* Light manual highlighting: green strings and test names, dim
	   keywords, near-white calls, muted punctuation. */
	.dod__l .c-s {
		color: #4ade80;
	}

	.dod__l .c-k {
		color: #a3a3a3;
	}

	.dod__l .c-f {
		color: #fafafa;
	}

	.dod__l .c-b {
		color: #737373;
	}

	@media (max-width: 40rem) {
		.dod__grid {
			grid-template-columns: 1fr;
			gap: 0.6rem;
		}

		.dod__arrow {
			transform: rotate(90deg);
		}
	}
</style>
